                    (8, "body", "aere pestilenti aut contagio ledatur.", "pestilent air, or contagion it be harmed.", ""),
                    (9, "body", "Aperit[ur] etiam carbunculis pestilentialibus s[i]", "It also opens pestilential carbuncles; if", ""),
